--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `while` keyword is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $count = 0;
whil<|>e ($count < 3) {
    $count = $count + 1;
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
